          "value": "The ubiquitin-like domain mediates interaction with the E3 ubiquitin-protein ligase RNF126 which is responsible for the BAG6-dependent ubiquitination of client proteins. SGTA also binds this domain and competes with RNF126 to antagonize client protein ubiquitination and degradation. The ubiquitin-like domain also mediates the interaction with USP13"
